<style>
  .ph-waist-guide {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 120px 20px 80px;
    color: #111;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide h1 {
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide h2 {
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 28px 0 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide__image {
    margin: 26px 0 34px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide__image img {
    max-width: 560px;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide__cta {
    margin-top: 30px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide__cta-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .ph-waist-guide__cta-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    background: #111;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ph-waist-guide { padding-top: 92px; }
    .ph-waist-guide h1 { font-size: 26px; }
    .ph-waist-guide h2 { font-size: 22px; }
    .ph-waist-guide p { font-size: 16px; }
    .ph-waist-guide__cta { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>

<section class="ph-waist-guide">
  <h1>Style + Size Guide Link</h1>

  <h2>How To Style The I.D. Waist Chain</h2>
  <p>Designed for an adjustable fit, they can be styled high on the waist or worn lower on the hips over your favourite fit.</p>
  <p>Designed to pair seamlessly with our I.D. letter pendants, add your letter onto the end of the chain and slide across to your desired position.</p>

  <div class="ph-waist-guide__image">
    <img src="{{ 'Waist_Chain_BG_Remove.png' | file_url }}" alt="Waist chain styling and placement guide" loading="lazy">
  </div>

  <div class="ph-waist-guide__cta">
    <p class="ph-waist-guide__cta-title">Styling or sizing question?</p>
    <a class="ph-waist-guide__cta-link" href="/pages/contact">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Ph Waist Chain Guide",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
